  "structure": "CSharp reserve requires the mutable owner and dispatches the committed collection family; all three SLG scheduling consumers use emitCollectionReserve and publish the updated owner.",
  "branches": "Array/heap used-byte copy, deque power-of-two ring-order copy, Int/general dictionary and Set load-factor occupancy rehash; unchanged capacity versus growth; primary/additional mutable parameter and local storage.",
